{%- comment -%}
  Quali8 — Scheduled announcement bar (home page app block).
  Fetches the active bar from the app proxy (/apps/quali8/announcement);
  the app decides visibility by date window, message, and colors — the
  merchant schedules everything from a special date's manage page. Renders
  nothing (zero layout shift) when no bar is scheduled for today.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="q8-announcement" data-quali8-announcement hidden></div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Announcement bar",
  "target": "section",
  "javascript": "announcement-bar.js",
  "stylesheet": "announcement-bar.css",
  "enabled_on": {
    "templates": ["index"]
  },
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
